  data: {
    LLM: 'Deal full hands. Turn: draw one (from stock or multiple from discard pile, per variant), meld sets/runs if desired, discard one. Going out ends the round; others count deadwood against them. Round scores (or penalties) accumulate; first to target wins.',
    Player: 'Deal full hands. Turn: draw one (from stock or multiple from discard pile, per variant), meld sets/runs if desired, discard one. Going out ends the round; others count deadwood against them. Round scores (or penalties) accumulate; first to target wins.',
    objective: 'Be the first player to reach the target score (often 5000) by melding sets and runs and going out; opponents add deadwood to your score.',
    gameplay: 'Deal full hands. Turn: draw one (from stock or multiple from discard pile, per variant), meld sets/runs if desired, discard one. Going out ends the round; others count deadwood against them. Round scores (or penalties) accumulate; first to target wins.',
